# Overlay ground-truth schedule (docs/design/overlay-ground-truth.md).
# One step per line: a name ([A-Za-z0-9._-]), then the netem arguments impair.sh applies to the
# probe's responder -> initiator traffic, or `none`. The first step must be `none`: every later
# step is compared with it. Steps run in file order; `#` starts a comment.
baseline         none
delay40          delay 40ms limit 100000
delay40-jitter5  delay 40ms 5ms distribution normal limit 100000
loss2            loss 2% limit 100000
rate20           rate 20mbit limit 1000
delay30-loss1    delay 30ms loss 1% limit 100000
